_Felsenstein%2C_Dan_Kottke.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/VCF_2025_-_Harry_Garland_with_Liza_Loop%2C_Lee_Felsenstein%2C_Dan_Kottke.jpg/500px-VCF_2025_-_Harry_Garland_with_Liza_Loop%2C_Lee_Felsenstein%2C_Dan_Kottke.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"2025 reunion at the Vintage Computer Festival with Daniel Kottke, Harry Garland, Lee Felsenstein, and Liza Loop","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVCF_2025_-_Harry_Garland_with_Liza_Loop%2C_Lee_Felsenstein%2C_Dan_Kottke.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Screenshot_of_Homebrew_Man_Page_on_MacOS_Sonoma.png/500px-Screenshot_of_Homebrew_Man_Page_on_MacOS_Sonoma.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Screenshot_of_Homebrew_Man_Page_on_MacOS_Sonoma.png/500px-Screenshot_of_Homebrew_Man_Page_on_MacOS_Sonoma.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AScreenshot_of_Homebrew_Man_Page_on_MacOS_Sonoma.png"}],"sounds":{}}}